{"title":"7-7.5 ft Artificial Christmas Trees","description":"\u003cp\u003eIncorporating a 7 Foot Artificial Christmas Tree into your holiday decor\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBring your holiday festivities to a whole new level with our 7 \u0026amp; 7.5 Foot Artificial Christmas Trees collection at Carol's Christmas Conifers. These beautifully crafted trees stand as a symbol of enchantment and are the perfect addition to your celebrations. Whether you're yearning for the classic charm of unlit trees or the convenience of pre-lit options, our collection has something for every Christmas enthusiast.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e7 \u0026amp; 7.5 ft Artificial Christmas Tree Colors \u0026amp; Styles\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDive into a world of color as you explore the rich and diverse palette of our Christmas trees. From the timeless allure of traditional rich green to the cool and refreshing shades of cool green and blue-green, you have the power to set the stage for a holiday season that's uniquely yours. Embrace the elegance of flocked green, or go bold and playful with eye-catching pink and blue. No matter your choice, each tree is a canvas awaiting your personal touch, ready to be transformed into a holiday masterpiece.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur 7 \u0026amp; 7.5 ft Artificial Christmas Tree Features\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCelebrate the most magical time of the year with the people you love, surrounded by the radiant glow of our handcrafted Christmas trees. Crafted with care, these trees are designed with hinged sections for a hassle-free setup, and we provide you with a tree stand and gloves to make the process even smoother. Safety is paramount during the holiday season, and our artificial Christmas trees are no exception. Rest easy knowing that they are flame-resistant, prioritizing your family's well-being. When the holiday season is over, our trees come with a convenient storage bag, ensuring they remain in pristine condition for many Christmases to come. Embrace the spirit of the season with Carol's Christmas Conifers and bring the magic of Christmas indoors, where cherished memories are created, and the wonder of the holidays truly comes to life.\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"7-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"7' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 400 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":41965569769672,"sku":"PF-T7-L","price":299.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrinceFlock_fa622227-8cc4-441c-b46e-a6f7c09044bd.jpg?v=1714675463"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-queen-flock-tree-unlit","title":"7.5' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642897461312,"sku":"QF-T7.5-U","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-5.jpg?v=1718158615"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-queen-flock-tree-led","title":"7.5' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 800 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642897657920,"sku":"QF-T7.5-L","price":599.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/QueenFlock_27cc53c6-965e-42b2-aec7-3712ea7dcff9.jpg?v=1722012616"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-king-flock-slim-tree-unlit","title":"7.5' King Flock® Slim Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Slim \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642901655616,"sku":"KFS-T7.5-U","price":299.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-4.jpg?v=1718158497"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-king-flock-slim-tree-led","title":"7.5' King Flock® Slim Artificial Christmas Tree with 650 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":28642901917760,"sku":"KFS-T7.5-L","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingFlockSlim_b2208eb9-116f-4bbb-8a55-3ac045ff327e.jpg?v=1714673454"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-king-flock-tree-unlit","title":"7.5' King Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642904178752,"sku":"KF-T7.5-U","price":349.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/king-flock-artificial-christmas-tree_36525e9c-27ba-46fb-b73f-75e48db45eb8.jpg?v=1718158692"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-king-flock-tree-led","title":"7.5' King Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 800 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642904670272,"sku":"KF-T7.5-L","price":499.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingFlock_8d5edfa3-23b9-49bf-b2